    "judgementRules": {
      "taskUnderstanding": "MECHANICAL PROXY + manual reading. A tool call is scored correct iff its `message` argument contains at least one token from EVERY intent-keyword group and contains NO forbidden token. Matching is case-insensitive, folds full-width digits, strips whitespace, and ALSO tries an identifier-normalised form with the separators `.`/`-`/`_` removed, so `voice.service.ts` = `voice-service.ts` = `voiceService.ts` (the chain is judged on whether it named the right target, not on punctuation an ASR transcript may vary). The mechanical proxy is recorded alongside the raw tool-call argument so a reader can re-judge; the manual reading is a human judgement on the raw argument.",
